s television advertising while trailing, and prediction markets price his chances at only a few percent. Most expert raters place the race at Likely Democratic or stronger, though a couple keep it at Lean Democratic. The state's slight Republican lean and the possibility of late outside spending are the main sources of residual uncertainty.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9425, "margin": 7.94}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.93, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9375, "margin": 8.2}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9346, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9278, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9264, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9322, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.939, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9386, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9577, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9557, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9557, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9528, "margin": 8.8}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9512, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9379, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9381, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.956, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9414, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9393, "margin": 9.0}]}